author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: The request-metadata parser accepts and validates io.modelcontextprotocol/logLevel against the specification enum and refuses an invalid level with -32602; A negative control proves no notifications/message frame is emitted on stdio and Streamable HTTP for a request that omits the key; The conformance matrix gains the row with owner and executable evidence and the deprecation inventory stays green
